    "scene": "Documentary still: realistic, natural light, muted archival color, the subject sharp and instantly recognizable.",
    "object": "A single object shown whole and in sharp focus against a plain pale background, realistic, muted color.",
    "diagram": "A clean educational illustration: simple clear shapes, strong contrast, plain pale background, one idea only."
  },
